      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저의 꿈을 이루기 위해\n꽁어름들을 모았어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C7580020AFC8C7440020C774B8E8AE300020C704D574000AAF41C5B4B984B4E4C7440020BAA8C558C5B4C6940021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 꿈이 뭐냐구요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020AFC8C7740020BB50B0D0AD6CC694003F001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바로 꽁어름 온 더 크레베이스!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B85C0020AF41C5B4B9840020C6280020B3540020D06CB808BCA0C774C2A40021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "커다란 크레베이스 위에 꽁어름들이\n올라탄 모습을 보는 게 제 꿈이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEE4B2E4B7800020D06CB808BCA0C774C2A40020C704C5D00020AF41C5B4B984B4E4C774000AC62CB77CD0C40020BAA8C2B5C7440020BCF4B2940020AC8C0020C81C0020AFC8C774C5D0C6940021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꽁꽁!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AF41AF4100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대단해 보이는 트레이너님께\n긴히 부탁드리고 싶은 게 있어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300B2E8D5740020BCF4C774B2940020D2B8B808C774B108B2D8AED8000AAE34D7880020BD80D0C1B4DCB9ACACE00020C2F6C7400020AC8C0020C788C5B4C694002E001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꽁어름 4마리가 올라탈 수 있을 만큼\n커다란 크레베이스를 제게 보여 주세요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n사이즈로 말하자면...\nXL 사이즈면 될 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꽁어름 4마리가 올라탈 수 있는\nXL 사이즈 크레베이스를 보여 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AF41C5B4B98400200034B9C8B9ACAC000020C62CB77CD0C80020C2180020C788B294000A0058004C0020C0ACC774C9880020D06CB808BCA0C774C2A4B97C0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꽁어름 4마리가 올라탈 수 있는\nXL 사이즈의 커다란 크레베이스를<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n제게 보여 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AF41C5B4B98400200034B9C8B9ACAC000020C62CB77CD0C80020C2180020C788B294000A0058004C0020C0ACC774C988C7580020CEE4B2E4B7800020D06CB808BCA0C774C2A4B97C00100001BE00000AC81CAC8C0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사이즈가 조금 부족한 것 같아요...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nXL 사이즈는 되어야\n꽁어름 4마리가 올라탈 수 있을 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC774C988AC000020C870AE080020BD80C871D55C0020AC830020AC19C544C694002E002E002E00100001BE01000A0058004C0020C0ACC774C988B2940020B418C5B4C57C000AAF41C5B4B98400200034B9C8B9ACAC000020C62CB77CD0C80020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C608C694002E001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쉽지만 히스이의 모습인 크레베이스는\n제가 원하는 모습과 달라요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C27DC9C0B9CC0020D788C2A4C774C7580020BAA8C2B5C7780020D06CB808BCA0C774C2A4B294000AC81CAC000020C6D0D558B2940020BAA8C2B5ACFC0020B2ECB77CC694002E001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우와...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0C640002E002E002E001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "진짜 크다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C4C9DC0020D06CB2E40021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "엄청 큰 우두머리!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5C4CCAD0020D0700020C6B0B450BA38B9AC0021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 정도면 모두 올라탈 수 있을 거예요!\n꽁어름들아, 다들 준비됐지!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C815B3C4BA740020BAA8B4500020C62CB77CD0C80020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C608C6940021000AAF41C5B4B984B4E4C544002C0020B2E4B4E40020C900BE44B410C9C00021003F001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꽁꽁!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AF41AF4100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꽁어름이 4마리나\n크레베이스 위에 올라타다니!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AF41C5B4B984C77400200034B9C8B9ACB098000AD06CB808BCA0C774C2A40020C704C5D00020C62CB77CD0C0B2E4B2C80021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 보고 싶었던 게 바로 이거예요!\n드디어 꿈이 이뤄졌어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C5C8B3580020AC8C0020BC14B85C0020C774AC70C608C6940021000AB4DCB514C5B40020AFC8C7740020C774B904C84CC5B4C6940021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아! 이참에 사진을 찍어서\nSNS에 올려야겠네요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54400210020C774CC38C5D00020C0ACC9C4C7440020CC0DC5B4C11C000A0053004E0053C5D00020C62CB824C57CACA0B124C6940021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "엥?\n에에에엥!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5E5003F000AC5D0C5D0C5D0C5E50021003F001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어머나 세상에나!\n사람들 반응이 엄청난데요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4BA38B0980020C138C0C1C5D0B0980021000AC0ACB78CB4E40020BC18C751C7740020C5C4CCADB09CB370C6940021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 보고 싶었던 만큼\n다른 사람들도 보고 싶었던 모양이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C5C8B3580020B9CCD07C000AB2E4B9780020C0ACB78CB4E4B3C40020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C5C8B3580020BAA8C591C774C5D0C6940021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꽁어름과 크레베이스의 매력을\n사람들에게 널리 알릴 수 있어서 기뻐요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이게 다 XL 사이즈 크레베이스를 빌려주신\n트레이너님 덕분이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꽁어름과 크레베이스의 매력을\n사람들에게 널리 알릴 수 있어서 기뻐요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이게 다 우두머리 크레베이스를 빌려주신\n트레이너님 덕분이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
